ding="async" style="max-height:56%;max-width:88%" class="w-auto shrink-0 object-contain"/></div></div><div style="grid-column:6 / span 1;grid-row:2"><div class="flex h-full w-full flex-col items-center justify-center gap-1"><img src="https://rihdbhaulfvzfhbafmax.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/logos/043d5796-240c-4970-918c-b67c577292fc/9f2df6de-5fd8-4549-8f15-37e0a7aa2137.png" alt="Sales Creator Collective" loading="lazy" decoding="async" style="max-height:56%;max-width:88%" class="w-auto shrink-0 object-contain"/></div></div><div style="grid-column:1 / span 2;grid-row:3"><div class="flex h-full w-full flex-col items-center justify-center gap-1"><img src="https://rihdbhaulfvzfhbafmax.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/logos/f5d7ff80-98e6-4cd6-b29a-a48622db6e84/9e79522c-71d1-462c-9bea-43b05c7cea0b.png" alt="Lorikeet" loading="lazy" decoding="async" style="max-height:56%;max-width:88%" class="w-auto shrink-0 object-contain"/></div></div><div style="grid-column:3 / span 2;grid-row:3"><div class="flex h-full w-full flex-col items-center justify-center gap-1"><img src="https://rihdbhaulfvzfhbafmax.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/logos/0d0f2bb3-aa93-41f4-b790-f961f01673f2/9b1a1df8-3a81-403c-81d7-a5bdfe32902a.png" alt="Conveo" loading="lazy" decoding="async" style="max-height:56%;max-width:88%" class="w-auto shrink-0 object-contain"/></div></div><div style="grid-column:5 / span 2;grid-row:3"><div class="flex h-full w-full flex-col items-center justify-center gap-1"><img src="https://rihdbhaulfvzfhbafmax.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/logos/353d0412-66ac-42a9-9754-a94c52b157f0/126313b4-203b-4fb8-ab58-cfb7a847672b.png" alt="Surf Office" loading="lazy" decoding="async" style="max-height:56%;max-width:88%" class="w-auto shrink-0 object-contain"/></div></div></div></div></div></span><span class="absolute left-1/2 top-0 z-10 flex -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 items-center gap-2 rounded-full border border-hairline bg-white py-1.5 pl-1.5 pr-1 shadow-[0_2px_10px_rgba(0,0,0,0.10)] transition-shadow group-hover:shadow-[0_4px_16px_rgba(0,0,0,0.16)]"><img src="https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2094784952055287808/dA01FGWO_400x400.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" class="h-6 w-6 shrink-0 rounded-full object-cover"/><span class="max-w-[9rem] truncate text-[13px] font-medium group-hover:underline">@<!-- -->giutheginger</span><span class="rounded-full bg-green/10 px-2.5 py-1 text-[13px] font-semibold tabular-nums text-green">$4,914</span></span></a></li></ul><div class="mt-12 text-center"><a class="inline-block rounded-full bg-blue px-6 py-3 text-[15px] font-medium text-white transition-colors hover:bg-blue-hover" href="/sell">Put your laptop up</a></div></section><section id="how" class="scroll-mt-20 mx-auto max-w-4xl px-6 py-16 md:py-24"><h2 class="text-3xl font-semibold tracking-[-0.015em] md:text-4xl">How it works</h2><p class="mt-4 max-w-[58ch] text-[16px] leading-relaxed text-ink-2"><strong class="font-medium text-ink">This is not an auction.</strong> <!-- -->Every spot has one price, set by the person who owns the laptop. The first brand to pay it takes it, for as long as the listing promised. Nobody bids, nobody is outbid, and nothing is taken back.</p><ol class="mt-10 space-y-10"><li class="flex gap-6" style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(18px)"><span aria-hidden="true" class="flex h-10 w-10 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-ink text-[15px] font-semibold text-white">1</span><div><h3 class="text-xl font-semibold">Set up your lid</h3><p class="mt-1.5 max-w-[58ch] leading-relaxed text-ink-2">Mac or PC, six or ten spots, your prices, how long the listing runs and how long the stickers stay. Sign in with X or LinkedIn, pay the one-off $19, connect your Stripe, and your lid is live at its own address.</p></div></li><li class="flex gap-6" style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(18px)"><span aria-hidden="true" class="flex h-10 w-10 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-ink text-[15px] font-semibold text-white">2</span><div><h3 class="text-xl font-semibold">Brands buy, you approve</h3><p class="mt-1.5 max-w-[58ch] leading-relaxed text-ink-2">A spot has one price, paid in full, straight into your own Stripe account. The first buyer takes it, and their logo waits for your approval before it goes anywhere near your laptop.</p></div></li><li class="flex gap-6" style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(18px)"><span aria-hidden="true" class="flex h-10 w-10 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-ink text-[15px] font-semibold text-white">3</span><div><h3 class="text-xl font-semibold">Stick them on, get paid</h3><p class="mt-1.5 max-w-[58ch] leading-relaxed text-ink-2">You print the stickers yourself — each spot lists its printed size — put them on your lid, and post the photo. Buyers pay into your own Stripe account; the platform keeps 10% and never touches the rest.</p></div></li></ol></section><section id="faq" class="mx-4 mt-4 scroll-mt-20 rounded-3xl bg-surface py-16 sm:mx-6 sm:mt-6 md:py-24 lg:mx-8"><div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-6"><h2 class="text-3xl font-semibold tracking-[-0.015em] md:text-4xl">Questions &amp; Answers</h2><div class="mt-8"><div class="border-b border-hairline"><button type="button" aria-expanded="true" class="flex w-full items-center justify-between gap-4 py-5 text-left"><span class="text-[16px] font-medium">Is this real?</span><span aria-hidden="true" class="shrink-0 text-xl leading-none text-ink-2">+</span></button><div class="overflow-hidden" style="height:auto;opacity:1"><div class="space-y-3 pb-6 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-ink-2"><p>It started as brandmymac.com — one MacBook lid, ten sticker spots, all of them sold, 7 613 € raised against a 2 529 € machine.</p><p>This site is that turned into a marketplace: anyone puts their own lid up, brands buy the spots on it, and the listing, the payment and the logo review are handled here.</p></div></div></div><div class="border-b border-hairline"><button type="button" aria-expanded="false" class="flex w-full items-center justify-between gap-4 py-5 text-left"><span class="text-[16px] font-medium">What does buying a spot actually get me?</span><span aria-hidden="true" class="shrink-0 text-xl leading-none text-ink-2">+</span></button></div><div class="border-b border-hairline"><button type="button" aria-expanded="false" class="flex w-full items-center justify-between gap-4 py-5 text-left"><span class="text-[16px] font-medium">How does paying work?</span><span aria-hidden="true" class="shrink-0 text-xl leading-none text-ink-2">+</span></button></div><div class="border-b border-hairline"><button type="button" aria-expanded="false" class="flex w-full items-center justify-between gap-4 py-5 text-left"><span class="text-[16px] font-medium">Who is actually taking my money?</span><span aria-hidden="true" class="shrink-0 text-xl leading-none text-ink-2">+</span></button></div><div class="border-b border-hairline"><button type="button" aria-expanded="false" class="flex w-full items-center justify-between gap-4 py-5 text-left"><span class="text-[16px] font-medium">What if my logo is refused?</span><span aria-hidden="true" class="shrink-0 text-xl leading-none text-ink-2">+</span></button></div><div class="border-b border-hairline"><button type="button" aria-expanded="false" class="flex w-full items-center justify-between gap-4 py-5 text-left"><span class="text-[16px] font-medium">What if the sticker never appears?</span><span aria-hidden="true" class="shrink-0 text-xl leading-none text-ink-2">+</span></button></div><div class="border-b border-hairline"><button type="button" aria-expanded="false" class="flex w-full items-center justify-between gap-4 py-5 text-left"><span class="text-[16px] font-medium">How do I put my own lid up?</span><span aria-hidden="true" class="shrink-0 text-xl leading-none text-ink-2">+</span></button></div></div></div></section><section id="traffic" class="scroll-mt-20 py-16 md:py-24"><div class="mx-auto max-w-5xl px-6"><div class="isolate overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-hairline bg-white" style="height:560px"></div></div></section><section id="waitlist" class="scroll-mt-20 py-16 md:py-24"><div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-6"><div class="rounded-3xl border border-hairline bg-white p-8 shadow-[0_1px_3px_rgba(0,0,0,0.06)] sm:p-10"><h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold tracking-[-0.015em] sm:whitespace-nowrap sm:text-3xl">What sold this week, every week</h2><p class="mt-3 max-w-[58ch] leading-relaxed text-ink-2">One email a week: the spots that sold, what brands paid for them, the laptops that went up, and what the whole board is worth. The numbers, not a newsletter about them.</p><div class="mt-6"><form class="space-y-3"><div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-3 sm:grid-cols-2"><input type="email" placeholder="your email" autoComplete="email" aria-label="Email" class="w-full rounded-xl border border-hairline bg-white px-4 py-3 text-[15px] outline-none transition-shadow placeholder:text-ink-2/70 focus:border-blue focus:ring-4 focus:ring-blue/15" value=""/><input type="text" placeholder="your X/Twitter handle (optional)" autoComplete="off" autoCapitalize="none" spellCheck="false" aria-label="X handle, optional" class="w-full rounded-xl border border-hairline bg-white px-4 py-3 text-[15px] outline-none transition-shadow placeholder:text-ink-2/70 focus:border-blue focus:ring-4 focus:ring-blue/15" value=""/></div><button type="submit" class="w-full rounded-full bg-blue px-6 py-3.5 text-[15px] font-medium text-white transition-colors hover:bg-blue-hover focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-blue disabled:opacity-60 sm:w-auto sm:px-8">Send me the weekly</button></form></div><p class="mt-4 text-[13px] leading-relaxed text-ink-2">Once a week, nothing else, and one click to stop.</p></div></div></section></main><footer class="border-t border-hairline"><div class="mx-auto max-w-5xl px-6 py-12"><div class="flex flex-col gap-10 sm:flex-row sm:justify-between"><div class="max-w-xs"><a class="flex items-center gap-2.5 text-[15px] font-semibold tracking-[-0.01em]" href="/"><img alt="" loading="lazy" width="256" height="171" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="h-7 w-auto" style="color:transparent" sizes="42px" srcSet="/_next/image?url=%2F_next%2Fstatic%2Fimmutable%2Fmedia%2Flogo-small.1zmf4nfgeac61.png&amp;w=32&amp;q=75 32w, /_next/image?url=%2F_next%2Fstatic%2Fimmutable%2Fmedia%2Flogo-small.1zmf4nfgeac61.png&amp;w=48&amp;q=75 48w, /_next/image?url=%2F_next%2Fstatic%2Fimmutable%2Fmedia%2Flogo-small.1zmf4nfgeac61.png&amp;w=64&amp;q=75 64w, /_next/image?url=%2F_next%2Fstatic%2Fimmutable%2Fmedia%2Flogo-small.1zmf4nfgeac61.png&amp;w=96&amp;q=75 96w, /_next/image?url=%2F_next%2Fstatic%2Fimmutable%2Fmedia%2Flogo-small.1zmf4nfgeac61.png&amp;w=128&amp;q=75 128w, /_next/image?url=%2F_next%2Fstatic%2Fimmutable%2Fmedia%2Flogo-small.1zmf4nfgeac61.png&amp;w=256&amp;q=75 256w, /_next/image?url=%2F_next%2Fstatic%2Fimmutable%2Fmedia%2Flogo-small.1zmf4nfgeac61.png&amp;w=384&amp;q=75 384w, /_next/image?url=%2F_next%2Fstatic%2Fimmutable%2Fmedia%2Flogo-small.1zmf4nfgeac61.png&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=%2F_next%2Fstatic%2Fimmutable%2Fmedia%2Flogo-small.1zmf4nfgeac61.png&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=%2F_next%2Fstatic%2Fimmutable%2Fmedia%2Flogo-small.1zmf4nfgeac61.png&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=%2F_next%2Fstatic%2Fimmutable%2Fmedia%2Flogo-small.1zmf4nfgeac61.png&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=%2F_next%2Fstatic%2Fimmutable%2Fmedia%2Flogo-small.1zmf4nfgeac61.png&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=%2F_next%2Fstatic%2Fimmutable%2Fmedia%2Flogo-small.1zmf4nfgeac61.png&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=%2F_next%2Fstatic%2Fimmutable%2Fmedia%2Flogo-small.1zmf4nfgeac61.png&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, /_next/image?url=%2F_next%2Fstatic%2Fimmutable%2Fmedia%2Flogo-small.1zmf4nfgeac61.png&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w" src="/_next/image?url=%2F_next%2Fstatic%2Fimmutable%2Fmedia%2Flogo-small.1zmf4nfgeac61.png&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75"/>BrandMyLaptop</a><p class="mt-3 text-[13px] leading-relaxed text-ink-2">Rent out your laptop lid. Brands buy the sticker spots; you print them and print money.</p><a href="https://x.com/vynsedev" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="mt-5 flex items-center gap-2 text-[13px] text-ink-2 transition-colors hover:text-ink">built by<img alt="" loading="lazy" width="1424" height="1424" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="h-5 w-5 rounded-full object-cover" style="color:transparent" sizes="20px" srcSet="/_next/image?url=%2F_next%2Fstatic%2Fimmutable%2Fmedia%2Fvincent.2710md5e2w-ud.webp&amp;w=32&amp;q=75 32w, /_next/image?url=%2F_next%2Fstatic%2Fimmutable%2Fmedia%2Fvincent.2710md5e2w-ud.webp&amp;w=48&amp;q=75 48w, /_next/image?url=%2F_next%2Fstatic%2Fimmutable%2Fmedia%2Fvincent.2710md5e2w-ud.webp&amp;w=64&amp;q=75 64w, /_next/image?url=%2F_next%2Fstatic%2Fimmutable%2Fmedia%2Fvincent.2710md5e2w-ud.webp&amp;w=96&amp;q=75 96w, /_next/image?url=%2F_next%2Fstatic%2Fimmutable%2Fmedia%2Fvincent.2710md5e2w-ud.webp&amp;w=128&amp;q=75 128w, /_next/image?url=%2F_next%2Fstatic%2Fimmutable%2Fmedia%2Fvincent.2710md5e2w-ud.webp&amp;w=256&amp;q=75 256w, /_next/image?url=%2F_next%2Fstatic%2Fimmutable%2Fmedia%2Fvincent.2710md5e2w-ud.webp&amp;w=384&amp;q=75 384w, /_next/image?url=%2F_next%2Fstatic%2Fimmutable%2Fmedia%2Fvincent.2710md5e2w-ud.webp&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=%2F_next%2Fstatic%2Fimmutable%2Fmedia%2Fvincent.2710md5e2w-ud.webp&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=%2F_next%2Fstatic%2Fimmutable%2Fmedia%2Fvincent.2710md5e2w-ud.webp&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=%2F_next%2Fstatic%2Fimmutable%2Fmedia%2Fvincent.2710md5e2w-ud.webp&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=%2F_next%2Fstatic%2Fimmutable%2Fmedia%2Fvincent.2710md5e2w-ud.webp&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=%2F_next%2Fstatic%2Fimmutable%2Fmedia%2Fvincent.2710md5e2w-ud.webp&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=%2F_next%2Fstatic%2Fimmutable%2Fmedia%2Fvincent.2710md5e2w-ud.webp&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, /_next/image?url=%2F_next%2Fstatic%2Fimmutable%2Fmedia%2Fvincent.2710md5e2w-ud.webp&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w" src="/_next/image?url=%2F_next%2Fstatic%2Fimmutable%2Fmedia%2Fvincent.2710md5e2w-ud.webp&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75"/><span class="font-medium">Vincent</span></a><p class="mt-4 max-w-[34ch] text-[12px] leading-relaxed text-ink-2">Started as<!-- --> <a href="https://brandmymac.com?ref=bml-footer" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="font-medium text-ink hover:underline">BrandMyMac</a> <!-- -->— one MacBook lid, ten sticker spots, 7 613 € raised, goal passed 301%. This is that, for everybody else.</p></div><nav class="flex flex-wrap gap-10 sm:gap-16"><div><h2 class="text-[13px] font-medium">Marketplace</h2><ul class="mt-3 space-y-2 text-[13px] text-ink-2"><li><a class="hover:text-ink" href="/">All laptops</a></li><li><a class="hover:text-ink" href="/sell">Sell your laptop</a></li><li><a class="hover:text-ink" href="/brands">Brands buying here</a></li><li><a class="hover:text-ink" href="/advertise">Advertise here</a></li><li><a class="hover:text-ink" href="/campaign">Book sticker spots</a></li><li><a class="hover:text-ink" href="/dashboard">Your dashboard</a></li></ul></div><div><h2 class="text-[13px] font-medium">About</h2><ul class="mt-3 space-y-2 text-[13px] text-ink-2"><li><a class="hover:text-ink" href="/#how">How it works</a></li><li><a class="hover:text-ink" href="/#faq">Questions</a></li><li><a class="hover:text-ink" href="/newsletter">Newsletter</a></li></ul></div><div><h2 class="text-[13px] font-medium">Laptops</h2><ul class="mt-3 space-y-2 text-[13px] text-ink-2"><li><a class="hover:text-ink" href="/laptops/coworking-spaces-and-cafes">In coworking spaces</a></li><li><a class="hover:text-ink" href="/laptops/conferences-and-meetups">At conferences</a></li><li><a class="hover:text-ink" href="/laptops/business-travel">On business travel</a></li><li><a class="hover:text-ink" href